# 💫 About Me:
Experienced .NET Developer with 4+ years of hands-on experience in building, maintaining, and modernizing web applications. Skilled in ASP.NET WebForms, .NET Core Web APIs, Angular, and GitHub CI/CD, with a strong focus on scalable, clean, and maintainable solutions.

